<Simple title="Privacy Policy | Blueprint Strategies" description="How Blueprint Strategies collects, uses and protects your personal information, including SMS communications.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Effective Date: August 2025</p>

  <p>Blueprint Strategies (“we,” “us,” “our”) and our clients respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you interact with our websites, forms, and SMS communications.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact details you provide (name, email, phone number)</li>
    <li>Message content and communication history</li>
    <li>Information about your project or service request</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We and our clients use your information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Send appointment reminders and service updates</li>
    <li>Send occasional promotional offers (only if you opt in)</li>
    <li>Respond to your inquiries</li>
    <li>Improve our services</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>SMS Communications</h2>
  <p>When you request a Blueprint Score or contact us, you can choose to check the optional opt-in box. If you do, you agree to receive text messages and calls, including automated and AI-assisted ones, from Blueprint Strategies about your Score, your Score Review call and our services. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP at any time to opt out, or HELP for help. Consent is not a condition of purchase or of getting your Score.</p>
  <p>If you opt in on a form for one of our client businesses, the messages come from that business, under the same terms.</p>

  <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. We share it only with the service providers that help us run our forms, calls and messages, with the specific client business you opted in to, or as required by law.</p>
  <p>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging opt-in data and consent are never shared with any third party.</p>

  <h2>Data Protection</h2>
  <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access or disclosure.</p>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You can request to access, correct, or delete your personal information at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:blueprintstrategiesagency@gmail.com">blueprintstrategiesagency@gmail.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, email us at <a href="mailto:blueprintstrategiesagency@gmail.com">blueprintstrategiesagency@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</Simple>
